# RDF/SHACL-inspired schema. This is intentionally a small experimental syntax.
prefix detroit https://detroitmi.gov/zoning/

class Agency
class HearingForum
class PublishedNotice
class PublicHearing
class LegalRequirement

property responsible_for domain Agency range PublishedNotice min 1
property forum_for domain HearingForum range PublicHearing min 1
property notice_for domain PublishedNotice range PublicHearing min 1
property required_by domain PublishedNotice range LegalRequirement min 1
property precedes domain PublishedNotice range PublicHearing min 1

individual BSEED types Agency,HearingForum
individual Chapter50 types LegalRequirement
